<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<%@ include file="header.jspf" %><h2>Danh sách users</h2><p><a class="button" href="users?action=new&amp;mode=<c:out value='${mode}'/>">Thêm user</a></p><form method="get" action="users" class="search"><input type="hidden" name="mode" value="<c:out value='${mode}'/>"><label>Country <input name="country" maxlength="50" value="<c:out value='${param.country}'/>"></label><label>Sắp xếp <select name="sort"><option value="id">ID</option><option value="name" ${param.sort eq 'name' ? 'selected' : ''}>Name</option></select></label><button>Tìm kiếm</button></form><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Name</th><th>Email</th><th>Country</th><th>Thao tác</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach var="u" items="${users}"><tr><td><c:out value="${u.id}"/></td><td><c:out value="${u.name}"/></td><td><c:out value="${u.email}"/></td><td><c:out value="${u.country}"/></td><td><a href="users?action=view&amp;id=${u.id}&amp;mode=${mode}">Xem</a> · <a href="users?action=edit&amp;id=${u.id}&amp;mode=${mode}">Sửa</a> · <a href="users?action=delete&amp;id=${u.id}&amp;mode=${mode}">Xóa</a></td></tr></c:forEach><c:if test="${empty users}"><tr><td colspan="5">Không có user phù hợp.</td></tr></c:if></tbody></table></div><section><h2>Thí nghiệm transaction</h2><p>Mỗi lần chạy sử dụng tên nhân viên riêng, không xóa dữ liệu cũ. Không đặt DDL trong transaction.</p><form action="users" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}"><input type="hidden" name="mode" value="${mode}"><button name="action" value="without-failure">526 · Không transaction, cố tình lỗi</button><button name="action" value="with-failure">527 · Transaction, cố tình lỗi</button><button name="action" value="with-success">527 · Transaction thành công</button><button name="action" value="user-rollback">529 · Lỗi FK khi gán quyền</button></form></section><%@ include file="footer.jspf" %>
